        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\nconfig:\n  theme: neutral\n  themeVariables:\n    fontFamily: Arial\n    fontSize: 15px\n    lineColor: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n    edgeLabelBackground: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;\n  flowchart:\n    curve: basis\n    nodeSpacing: 45\n    rankSpacing: 130\n    htmlLabels: true\n---\n\n%% Figure: Safety Certification Use Case Diagram\n%% Beaker Breakers Studio\n%% Scope: safety training, tier assessment and certificate issue\n%% Source: Chapter 3 requirements FR-02.1 to FR-02.9 and FR-10.5\n%%         SRS Section 20, UC-02 Safety Certification\n\n%% Shape note: Mermaid has no ellipse shape. Use cases are drawn here with the\n%% stadium shape ([text]), which is the nearest oval Mermaid offers. The\n%% Graphviz version of this figure (safety_uc.dot) uses true UML ellipses and\n%% is the one to place in the report.\n\nflowchart LR\n\n    %% ================= Actors =================\n    Student[\&quot;Student\&quot;]\n    Teacher[\&quot;Teacher\&quot;]\n    Admin[\&quot;Administrator\&quot;]\n\n    %% ================= System boundary =================\n    subgraph SYS[\&quot;Beaker Breakers Studio (Safety Certification Scope)\&quot;]\n        UC02([\&quot;UC-02&lt;br/&gt;Safety Certification\&quot;])\n        UC021([\&quot;UC-02.1&lt;br/&gt;Attempt Tier Assessment\&quot;])\n        RAND([\&quot;Select Random Questions&lt;br/&gt;from Tier Bank\&quot;])\n        SCORE([\&quot;Compute Score&lt;br/&gt;on Server\&quot;])\n        UNLOCK([\&quot;Unlock Next Tier\&quot;])\n        UC022([\&quot;UC-02.2&lt;br/&gt;Receive Safety Certificate\&quot;])\n        REATT([\&quot;Reattempt Failed Tier\&quot;])\n        VIEW([\&quot;View Own Safety Certificate\&quot;])\n        UC26([\&quot;UC-26&lt;br/&gt;Verify Student Certificates\&quot;])\n        UC21([\&quot;UC-21&lt;br/&gt;Manage Certificate Registry\&quot;])\n        EXPORT([\&quot;Export Certificate Register\&quot;])\n        UC03([\&quot;UC-03&lt;br/&gt;Perform Virtual Experiment\&quot;])\n    end\n\n    %% ================= Actor associations =================\n    Student --- UC02\n    Student --- UC03\n    Student --- VIEW\n    Teacher --- UC26\n    Admin --- UC21\n\n    %% ================= Include relationships =================\n    UC02 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.1\&quot;| UC021\n    UC02 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.2\&quot;| UNLOCK\n    UC02 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.7\&quot;| UC022\n    UC021 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.4\&quot;| RAND\n    UC021 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.5\&quot;| SCORE\n    UC03 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.3&lt;br/&gt;Tier 1 gate\&quot;| UC02\n    UC21 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-10.5\&quot;| EXPORT\n\n    %% ================= Extend relationship =================\n    REATT -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-02.6&lt;br/&gt;[score below 80 percent]\&quot;| UC021\n\n    %% ================= Constraint notes =================\n    %% FR-02.1: the four sequential tiers are Basic Lab Rules, Chemical Handling,\n    %%          Fire and Heat Safety, and First Aid and Emergency.\n    %% FR-02.8: no certificate is issued if any tier score is below 80 percent,\n    %%          and an issued certificate is never deleted or revoked.\n    %% FR-02.9: the certificate is shown on the student profile and to the\n    %%          teacher assigned to that student&#39;s class, which is why both\n    %%          View Own Safety Certificate and UC-26 appear here.\n\n    %% ================= Styling (outline only, no fill colour) =================\n    classDef actor fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n    classDef uc fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n\n    class Student,Teacher,Admin actor\n    class UC02,UC021,RAND,SCORE,UNLOCK,UC022,REATT,VIEW,UC26,UC21,EXPORT,UC03 uc\n\n    style SYS fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="31">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
